  "scope": "Exact Rust macOS package and Linux ARM64/x64 images. Both runtimes use the standalone bootstrap mode. Anonymous, password and accounts cases use real HTTP and App Live, the unchanged worker queue SDK and controlled worker replies. The Node reference runs on the macOS host, with a separate portable PostgreSQL fixture for its comparison with bundled PostgreSQL. Linux x64 runs translated on Apple Silicon.",
  "databaseSetup": "Each embedded Linux profile is provisioned while its server is stopped using the packaged PostgreSQL single-user backend on the same isolated volume. The adapter performs only the fixture query and seed transaction, and all observed queue traffic goes through the normal service. No runtime or data directory crosses platforms.",
