  "revisionZeroContract": "The first empty read creates a durable revision-zero row with notified_revision -1. Its periodic delivery can run before revision one or the two revisions can coalesce. The harness holds the first mutation until revision zero is actually delivered to the worker and read by the SDK, then compares all commits and all 21 invalidations per profile.",
